
## Debugging

By default, debug messages for this plugin are hidden.

To show them, install [`Advanced Debug Mode`](https://community.obsidian.md/plugins/advanced-debug-mode), run **`Advanced Debug Mode`: Open plugin debug messages** and tick `<%= pluginName %>`. To flip only this plugin, run **`Advanced Debug Mode`: Toggle debug messages for a plugin...** and pick `<%= pluginName %>`.

Without `Advanced Debug Mode`, run the following command in the `DevTools Console`:

```js
window.DEBUG.enable('<%= pluginId %>');
```

For more details, refer to the [documentation](https://mnaoumov.dev/obsidian-lib/guides/debugging/).
